WEBVTT

00:00:29.776 --> 00:00:33.738
he checked the boxes corresponding
to what must have been important

00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:36.407
for kids' physical
development in the '70s.

00:00:36.824 --> 00:00:39.285
Oh, except the one
on leadership qualities,

00:00:39.327 --> 00:00:41.370
he left that one unchecked.

00:00:42.038 --> 00:00:43.664
Then he added a note.

00:00:43.706 --> 00:00:47.543
He said, "Andrea
has difficulty kicking balls."

00:00:47.543 --> 00:00:51.380
(Laughter)

00:00:51.422 --> 00:00:55.843
My dad, who was always the one to see
people's gifts instead of their limits,

00:00:55.885 --> 00:00:58.179
wrote a letter back to Mr. Jensen.

00:00:58.221 --> 00:01:01.224
He said, "Andrea may have
difficulty kicking balls,